{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00490",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.34,
      "end_seconds": 8.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "Hi, uh, doctor, I brought my bag, is it fine to leave it here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.28,
      "end_seconds": 13.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.77,
      "end_seconds": 18.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.71,
      "end_seconds": 28.83,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a ring-shaped itchy patch. It's getting on my nerves now. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.73,
      "end_seconds": 34.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "And when did that start? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.83,
      "end_seconds": 43.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "It's been two months now. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.58,
      "end_seconds": 52.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.31,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.2,
      "end_seconds": 61.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly. I notice it more with sweating. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.27,
      "end_seconds": 68.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 68.83,
      "end_seconds": 73.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.79,
      "end_seconds": 86.75,
      "duration_seconds": 10.96,
      "text": "I was getting to that! Yeah, I've had darker skin around the patch too, for four weeks. And itching between the toes as well, since this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 87.52,
      "end_seconds": 90.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Mm, that's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.56,
      "end_seconds": 94.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Alright, any new partner, pus, pain or rash on the palms?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.58,
      "end_seconds": 110.08,
      "duration_seconds": 11.5,
      "text": "No, no new partner, no pus, no pain. I did have scaly, peeling skin at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.78,
      "end_seconds": 112.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Have you had any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.68,
      "end_seconds": 115.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "No, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 115.72,
      "end_seconds": 121.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "Actually, um, doctor, I did notice fever. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.99,
      "end_seconds": 126.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.91,
      "end_seconds": 134.98,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Have you had any similar rash on the scalp?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.15,
      "end_seconds": 139.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "No similar rash on the scalp, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.4,
      "end_seconds": 143.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.45,
      "end_seconds": 145.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.92,
      "end_seconds": 153.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "So, any long-term health problems I should know about? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.11,
      "end_seconds": 167.0,
      "duration_seconds": 9.89,
      "text": "Diabetes, for about ten years. I've never really been one for hospitals. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.75,
      "end_seconds": 168.45,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.91,
      "end_seconds": 188.01,
      "duration_seconds": 19.1,
      "text": "Um, I have an irregular heartbeat, for five years. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. I've got anxiety. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I kept putting it off, you know, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.31,
      "end_seconds": 192.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Right. Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.31,
      "end_seconds": 199.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Okay, so my father had a heart attack. My sister has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.02,
      "end_seconds": 201.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.47,
      "end_seconds": 206.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.45,
      "end_seconds": 208.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.95,
      "end_seconds": 212.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.16,
      "end_seconds": 216.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.29,
      "end_seconds": 227.55,
      "duration_seconds": 10.26,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.28,
      "end_seconds": 234.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Okay, what medicines are you taking at the moment? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.48,
      "end_seconds": 238.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I'm on glimepiride, 2 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 239.55,
      "end_seconds": 243.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 4 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.69,
      "end_seconds": 247.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.63,
      "end_seconds": 258.37,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Oh, I'm on bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.39,
      "end_seconds": 262.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.15,
      "end_seconds": 267.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.4,
      "end_seconds": 276.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "It's a... um, um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.02,
      "end_seconds": 279.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.39,
      "end_seconds": 291.85,
      "duration_seconds": 11.46,
      "text": "For the anxiety, I believe. My daughter sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. Candid cream. I take it twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 292.94,
      "end_seconds": 300.07,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Saturation 99 percent, pulse 73, pressure 114 over 75. Temperature is 37.0 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.37,
      "end_seconds": 302.07,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.22,
      "end_seconds": 307.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.99,
      "end_seconds": 310.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.4,
      "end_seconds": 328.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Skin between the toes is white and peeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.64,
      "end_seconds": 331.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.56,
      "end_seconds": 350.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "There's a red ring-shaped scaly patch with a clearer centre in the groin crease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.73,
      "end_seconds": 353.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.13,
      "end_seconds": 378.8,
      "duration_seconds": 20.67,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like a fungal skin infection. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. It could also be psoriasis, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.42,
      "end_seconds": 381.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.76,
      "end_seconds": 404.3,
      "duration_seconds": 21.54,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a fungal skin infection, and we'll know more once the a skin scraping is back. Let's get a skin scraping, for suspected fungal infection. I'd like you to take terbinafine cream, once a day, for two weeks. It's for fungal infection. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 405.01,
      "end_seconds": 406.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 407.58,
      "end_seconds": 422.58,
      "duration_seconds": 15.0,
      "text": "Keep the area dry, wear loose cotton, and don't share towels. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 423.24,
      "end_seconds": 424.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 426.1,
      "end_seconds": 431.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.73,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 434.99,
      "end_seconds": 437.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 438.11,
      "end_seconds": 440.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Come back in three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 440.44,
      "end_seconds": 445.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Well, sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 446.23,
      "end_seconds": 450.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 451.45,
      "end_seconds": 453.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "I appreciate your time, doctor."
    }
  ]
}